      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Už v timeline"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Interface": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rozhraní"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Into the next clip": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Do dalšího klipu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Invents in-between frames": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dopočítá chybějící snímky"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Invert": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Obrátit"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Invert (swap subject and background)": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Invertovat (prohodit objekt a pozadí)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It all goes to your own iCloud, never to us. You can change it any time in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Všechno jde jen do tvého vlastního iCloudu, nikam jinam. Změnit to můžeš kdykoli v Nastavení."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It can take a little while. Your original files stay as they are.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Může to chvilku trvat. Původní soubory zůstanou, jak jsou."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It disappears forever, together with its imported videos. There is no trash bin. Your originals in Photos stay.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zmizí navždy i s importovanými videi. Koš tu není. Originály ve Fotkách zůstanou."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It plays over the footage past the cut where the clips have some, so nothing is cut away. Where they don't, the clips overlap and the video gets a little shorter.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Přechod využije záběry za střihem, pokud v klipech nějaké zbývají, takže se nic neusekne. Kde nezbývají, klipy se překryjí a video se trochu zkrátí."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Italic": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kurzíva"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its video (%@) can't be played on iPhone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jeho video (%@) iPhone neumí přehrát."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nechat"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep BOMBOCUT": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "BOMBOCUT napořád"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep borders": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nechat okraje"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep centered": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Držet uprostřed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep in place": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Držet na místě"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep music from other apps playing": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nechat hrát hudbu z jiných aplikací"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep pitch": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zachovat výšku tónu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep the app open while exporting.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Během exportu nech aplikaci otevřenou."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep the app open. Wi-Fi recommended.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nech aplikaci otevřenou. Radši přes Wi-Fi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep the outside instead.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nechá to, co je kolem."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keeps only the people or the main subject, and makes the rest of the overlay see-through. Nothing is removed for good: switch it off any time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nechá jen lidi nebo hlavní objekt a zbytek překrytí zprůhlední. Nic se nemaže natrvalo, kdykoli to zase vypneš."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kept": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zachováno"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keyframes, transitions, text and overlays": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keyframy, přechody, texty a překrytí"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Knows this language pair. Quick, nothing to download.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tyhle dva jazyky umí. Rychlé a nic se nestahuje."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Last modified": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Naposledy upraveno"
          }
        }
      }
    },
