    "Pick a subject (a rider, a face, a sign). BOMBOCUT tracks it through the clip and holds it in place, so the shake and the movement go into everything around it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vyber objekt (jezdce, obličej, ceduli). BOMBOCUT ho sleduje celým klipem a drží ho na místě, takže otřesy a pohyb přejdou na všechno kolem."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pick again": {
