          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Text"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text ": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Text "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text and picture length": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Délka textu a obrázku"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Texture": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Textura"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The captions are in %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Titulky jsou v jazyce %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The clip comes in from black or goes out to black. For the start and the end of the video.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Klip naběhne z černé nebo do černé odejde. Hodí se na začátek a konec videa."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The clips changed while stacking. Try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Klipy se mezitím změnily. Zkus to znovu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The curve stretches with the clip": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Křivka se natáhne s klipem"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The download didn't finish. Try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stahování se nedokončilo. Zkus to znovu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The download server didn't answer properly. Try again later.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Server pro stahování neodpověděl správně. Zkus to později."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The download was incomplete. Try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stahování se nedokončilo. Zkus to znovu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The end of the video: the clip goes out to black.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Konec videa: klip odejde do černé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The filter goes from your filters. Clips that use it keep their look.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Filtr zmizí z tvých filtrů. Klipy, které ho používají, si svůj vzhled nechají."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first clip goes out and the next one comes in the same way, through black.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "První klip odejde a další nastoupí stejným způsobem, přes černou."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The matte is ready": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alfa maska je hotová"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The purchase is waiting for approval.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nákup čeká na schválení."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The speech model is about 650 MB. Wi-Fi is better.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hlasový model má asi 650 MB. Radši přes Wi-Fi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The speech model is missing from the app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "V aplikaci chybí hlasový model."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The stack's own way in": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Příchod celého Stacku"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The stack's own way out": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Odchod celého Stacku"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The start of the video: the clip comes in from black.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Začátek videa: klip naběhne z černé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The subject keeps its size from this frame": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Objekt si drží velikost z tohoto snímku"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The translation becomes a second captions track, a line above these, with its own style. Both stay editable.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Překlad bude jako druhá stopa titulků, o řádek výš a s vlastním stylem. Obě půjdou dál upravovat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The translation model needs an iPhone 15 Pro or newer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Překladový model potřebuje iPhone 15 Pro nebo novější."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The translation model translates better and knows more languages, Czech and Slovak too. One download, %@, then it works offline.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Překladový model překládá lépe a umí víc jazyků, i češtinu a slovenštinu. Stáhne se jednou (%@), pak funguje offline."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The translation replaces the captions, with the same style and timing. Undo brings the original back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Překlad nahradí titulky, styl i časování zůstanou. Dá se to vrátit."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The transparent video is ready": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Průhledné video je hotové"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The video overlay plays faster or slower; its sound keeps its pitch.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Video v překrytí hraje rychleji nebo pomaleji, zvuk si drží výšku tónu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The video's settings are missing from this file.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "V souboru chybí nastavení videa."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The video's settings in this file can't be read.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nastavení videa v tomhle souboru nejde přečíst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Then buy it once, or don't.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pak ho jednou koupíš, nebo ne."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There isn't enough free space for this video (it needs about %@). Free up some space or pick a lower bitrate, then try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Na tohle video není dost volného místa (potřebuje asi %@). Uvolni trochu místa nebo zvol nižší datový tok a zkus to znovu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They can't be brought back. Their clips leave iCloud within a day.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Už je nepůjde vrátit. Jejich klipy zmizí z iCloudu do jednoho dne."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They come back by themselves once iCloud Photos has them on this device (Settings > Photos > iCloud Photos). Until then the project plays without them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vrátí se samy, jakmile je Fotky na iCloudu budou mít i na tomhle zařízení (Nastavení > Fotky > Fotky na iCloudu). Do té doby se projekt přehrává bez nich."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They disappear forever, together with their imported videos. There is no trash bin. Your originals in Photos stay.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zmizí navždy i s importovanými videi. Koš tu není. Originály ve Fotkách zůstanou."
          }
        }
      }
    },
